# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
#
# The texts of the website and the console in a spreadsheet for the people who review a language
# ([[languages]]), and their corrections back into the message files. One workbook per language, for
# Excel, LibreOffice or Google Sheets: reviewers need no JSON and cannot break a file. Only the Python
# standard library.
#
#   tools/translation-review export [DIR]        write the workbooks (default: out/translation-review)
#   tools/translation-review import FILE         check a returned workbook, change nothing
#   tools/translation-review import FILE --apply the same, then write the corrections
#
# A text identical in every language (a button's name, the slogan, F12) is not listed: nothing to review.

